  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3718,
      "text": "Give them an example of the People of the Town when the messengers came to it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3719,
      "text": "When We sent them two [messengers], but they rejected them, so We strengthened them with a third, and they said, “We are sent to you as messengers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3720,
      "text": "They said, “You are no more than human beings like us, and the Most Compassionate has not sent down anything. You are simply lying.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3721,
      "text": "They said, “Our Lord knows that we are sent to you as messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3722,
      "text": "Our duty is only to convey the message clearly.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3723,
      "text": "The people said, “We consider you as an evil omen. If you do not desist, we will surely stone you, and we will inflict upon you a painful punishment.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3724,
      "text": "The messengers said, “Your evil omen is with yourselves [because of your disbelief]. Is it[5] because you are admonished? Rather, you are a people who transgress all bounds.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3725,
      "text": "A man came from the farthest end of the city, rushing, and said, “O my people, follow the messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3726,
      "text": "Follow those who ask no recompense of you, and who are guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3727,
      "text": "Why should I not worship the One Who created me and to Whom you will all be brought back?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3728,
      "text": "Should I take besides Him other gods whose intercession cannot avail me in the least, nor can they come to my rescue, if the Most Compassionate wills to harm me?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3729,
      "text": "Surely I would then be clearly misguided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3730,
      "text": "I believe in your Lord, so listen to me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3731,
      "text": "[But they killed him], so he was told[6], “Enter Paradise.” He said, “If only my people knew[7]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 441,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 176,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3732,
      "text": "of how my Lord has forgiven me, and made me among the honored ones.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
